From 0ac5880ad9f312fa7deded674024f25c17ea36d2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian Blenke <ian@blenke.com>
Date: Fri, 19 Jun 2026 19:51:30 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 02928/11362] [outer-loop] durable systemd timer for daily ARC
 submission prep (validated end-to-end)

carnot-arc-daily-prep.timer (daily 09:37 EDT, Persistent) runs the prep script
session-independently: refresh dataset -> re-push public kernel -> validate ->
write ops/arc-daily-prep-status.json. Never submits (operator-gated --submit-only).
Retired the session-only cron. Unit copies tracked in ops/systemd/.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
